{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2384,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.knotscripts.hideoutautomation",
  "name": "Hideout Automation",
  "slug": "hideout-automation",
  "teaser": "This mod automates hideout crafting, constructions, upgrades and installations. Stack crafts. Optionally choose which requirements to skip. FIKA is supported.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/H5aAQRss6EZwqBKlTC44U7qJgzVUeiXDgJ3NK991.jpg",
  "downloads": 13051,
  "favourites_count": 36,
  "description": "<p><strong>Tired of spending too much time in menus?</strong></p>\n<p>New Features (Experimental):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(Crafting) Production stacking (<strong>Queue multiple productions</strong>) When one finishes, the next starts automatically.</li>\n<li><em>Requirements are paid upfront when stacking.</em></li>\n<li><em>Automation only runs while in-game (and not in raid).</em></li>\n<li><em>Tools are only required once for the full production stack.</em></li>\n<li>Automatically moves <strong>produced items to stash</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Stack button</strong> instead of Start button.</li>\n<li>Shows stacked amount and total amount in production.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This mod automates several hideout-related action to streamline your experience:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically construct when requirements are met (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Automatically upgrade when requirements are met (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Automatically install construction or upgrade when completed (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Use a dialog window to accept the costs and requirements of the construction or upgrade (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2076/hideout-in-progress\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tyfon-HideoutInProgress (HIP)</a></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>(Experimental) HIP mod support. If you have HIP mod installed the HideoutAutomation mod will automate the contributions to HIP.</li>\n<li>(Option) to enable the automated contributions to HIP. When disabled the mod wont do anything for HIP.</li>\n<li>(Option) to only contribute when Area Requirements are met. (default: on) When enabled,  automated contributions are made only after all required items are collected. Partial amounts will no longer be contributed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Remove requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inspired by the Skipper mod by Terkoiz (for tasks), the mod adds the ability to automatically remove requirements of the construction or upgrade costs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can toggle the following requirements types: (all default to <strong>on</strong>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove other area requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove currency* requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove skill requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove trader requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove item requirements.\n*currency requirements are: Rubles, Dollars and Euros.\nSwitching these settings pops up a dialog for your game to reload so the hideout shows the correct requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>The mod starts working from the start of the game.</p>\n<h3>Installation:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the mod file using the button above.</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded archive.</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder into your SPT installation directory.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Planned Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideas are welcome.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Known Issues:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No known issues at this time.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Limitations:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No known limitations at this time.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Compatibility:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No known conflicts with other mods.</li>\n<li>FIKA is now supported.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Recommended Mods:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2238/task-automation\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Task automation</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
