      "version": "1.2.5",
      "description": "<p>Fixes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Patched HideoutController.UpgradeComplete to check if stage level exists before setting it.</li>\n<li>Added check if area was constructing to prevent level going up to max when not intended on client glitch.</li>\n<li><strong>Added logic to fix player profiles that got bugged out by allowing levels higher then max level.</strong></li>\n<li>Prevent “Unable to edit a traders item” message from throwing.</li>\n<li>Finally found a way to hard refresh the draw of SimpleStashPanel. So contributed items will disappear preventing the game from breaking.</li>\n<li>Changed from Last in First out to First in First out for productions stacks.</li>\n<li>Added check to see if a production (still) exists in the profile. Preventing the “Unable to find production recipe” message.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please report any bugs or problems you encounter by creating an issue here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PMouse23/SPT-HideoutAutomation/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/PMouse23/SPT-HideoutAutomation/issues</a></p>\n",
