      "description": "<p>New Features / Options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(Experimental) <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2076/hideout-in-progress\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tyfon-HideoutInProgress (HIP)</a> mod support. If you have HIP mod installed the hideoutautomation mod will automate the contributions to HIP.</li>\n<li>(Option) to disable the automated contributions to HIP.</li>\n<li>(Option) to only contribute when Area Requirements are met. (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let me know if you find some bugs or missing features.</p>\n",
