      "version": "1.0.0",
      "description": "<p><strong>Tired of spending too much time in menus?</strong></p>\n<p>This mod automates several hideout-related action to streamline your experience:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically construct when requirements are met (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Automatically upgrade when requirements are met (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Automatically install construction or upgrade when completed (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n<li>Use a dialog window to accept the costs and requirements of the construction or upgrade (default: <strong>on</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Inspired by the Skipper mod by Terkoiz (for tasks), the mod adds the ability to automatically remove requirements of the construction or upgrade costs.</p>\n<p>You can toggle the following requirements types: (all default to <strong>on</strong>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove other area requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove currency* requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove skill requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove trader requirements.</li>\n<li>Remove item requirements.\n*currency requirements are: Rubles, Dollars and Euros.\nSwitching these settings pops up a dialog for your game to reload so the hideout shows the correct requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n",
